 "lobby.help.main.title": ["§bLobby Protection Help", "§bBantuan Proteksi Lobi"],
 "lobby.help.main.body": ["§e=== Advanced Lobby Protection System ===\n§fSelect a help category:", "§e=== Sistem Proteksi Lobi Canggih ===\n§fPilih kategori bantuan:"],
 "lobby.help.main.btn.admin": ["Admin Setup\n§7Configure admin access", "Setup Admin\n§7Atur akses admin"],
 "lobby.help.main.btn.usage": ["Usage Guide\n§7System usage instructions", "Panduan Penggunaan\n§7Instruksi penggunaan sistem"],
 "lobby.help.main.btn.features": ["Features\n§7Complete feature list", "Fitur\n§7Daftar fitur lengkap"],
 "lobby.help.admin.title": ["§bAdmin Configuration", "§bKonfigurasi Admin"],
 "lobby.help.admin.body": ["§e=== Admin Setup ===\n§fTo grant admin privileges:\n\n§f/tag <player> add admin\n\n§7§ Only 'admin' tagged players can access protection menu\n§7 Admins bypass all lobby protections\n§7 Admins can create, edit, and delete regions\n§7 Use §f/removeadmin <player> §7to revoke access", "§e=== Setup Admin ===\n§fUntuk memberi hak akses admin:\n\n§f/tag <player> add admin\n\n§7§ Hanya pemain dengan tag 'admin' yang bisa akses menu proteksi\n§7 Admin melewati semua proteksi lobi\n§7 Admin bisa buat, edit, dan hapus wilayah\n§7 Gunakan §f/removeadmin <player> §7untuk cabut akses"],
 "lobby.help.usage.title": ["§bUsage Instructions", "§bInstruksi Penggunaan"],
 "lobby.help.usage.body": ["§e=== System Usage ===\n§fStep-by-step guide:\n\n§71. Ensure you have 'admin' tag\n§72. Access lobby protection menu\n§73. Set Position 1 (first corner)\n§74. Set Position 2 (second corner)\n§75. Create region with custom name\n§76. Configure protection settings\n§77. Manage regions through menu interface", "§e=== Penggunaan Sistem ===\n§fPanduan langkah demi langkah:\n\n§71. Pastikan kamu punya tag 'admin'\n§72. Buka menu proteksi lobi\n§73. Atur Posisi 1 (sudut pertama)\n§74. Atur Posisi 2 (sudut kedua)\n§75. Buat wilayah dengan nama kustom\n§76. Atur konfigurasi proteksi\n§77. Kelola wilayah lewat antarmuka menu"],
 "lobby.help.features.title": ["§bProtection Features", "§bFitur Proteksi"],
 "lobby.help.features.body": ["§e=== Complete Feature Set ===\n\n§6World Protection:\n§7§ Block break/place prevention\n§7§ Block interaction control\n§7§ Item usage restrictions\n§7§ Entity interaction protection\n§7§ Item frame security\n§7§ Fire spread prevention\n§7§ Explosion blocking\n\n§6Player Management:\n§7§ Automatic inventory save/restore\n§7§ PVP disable in protected zones\n§7§ Damage protection (resistance effect)\n§7§ Hunger protection (saturation effect)\n§7§ Weakness effect for non-admins\n\n§6Entity Control:\n§7§ Mob spawn prevention\n§7§ Item drop protection\n§7§ Custom entity whitelist\n§7§ Automatic entity cleanup\n\n§6Visual Features:\n§7§ Particle effects on protection trigger\n§7§ Region boundary indicators\n§7§ Action bar notifications\n§7§ Custom status messages\n\n§6Performance:\n§7§ Optimized caching system\n§7§ Chunk-based fire scanning\n§7§ Efficient region detection\n§7§ Low-latency event handling", "§e=== Set Fitur Lengkap ===\n\n§6Proteksi Dunia:\n§7§ Pencegahan hancur/letak blok\n§7§ Kontrol interaksi blok\n§7§ Batasan penggunaan item\n§7§ Proteksi interaksi entitas\n§7§ Keamanan item frame\n§7§ Pencegahan api menyebar\n§7§ Pemblokiran ledakan\n\n§6Manajemen Pemain:\n§7§ Simpan/pilih otomatis inventori\n§7§ PVP nonaktif di zona terproteksi\n§7§ Proteksi damage (efek resistance)\n§7§ Proteksi lapar (efek saturation)\n§7§ Efek weakness buat non-admin\n\n§6Kontrol Entitas:\n§7§ Pencegahan spawn mob\n§7§ Proteksi item drop\n§7§ Whitelist entitas kustom\n§7§ Pembersihan entitas otomatis\n\n§6Fitur Visual:\n§7§ Efek partikel saat proteksi terpicu\n§7§ Indikator batas wilayah\n§7§ Notifikasi action bar\n§7§ Pesan status kustom\n\n§6Performa:\n§7§ Sistem caching teroptimasi\n§7§ Pemindaian api berbasis chunk\n§7§ Deteksi wilayah efisien\n§7§ Penanganan event latensi rendah"],
