 "tpa.msg.moved": ["Teleport cancelled - You moved!", "Teleport batal - Kamu gerak!", "Teleporte cancelado - Você se moveu!", "ยกเลิกเทเลพอร์ต - คุณขยับ!", "Cancelled - gumalaw ka!", "tp中止 - 動いちゃった!"],
