 "tpa.msg.you_disabled": ["You have requests off. Turn it on first.", "Permintaan teleport kamu mati. Nyalain dulu.", "Seus pedidos estão desligados. Liga primeiro.", "คุณปิดรับคำขออยู่ เปิดก่อนนะ", "Naka-off ang requests mo. I-on mo muna.", "申請オフになってるよ。まずオンにして。"],
