  "npc.schedule.menu.title": ["NPC Schedule", "Jadwal NPC"],
  "npc.schedule.menu.body": ["§7Set when this NPC can be clicked by members.\n\n§fStatus: %s\n§fState: %s\n\n§7Closed Duration: §f%s §7(time closed before opening)\n§7Open Duration: §f%s §7(time open before closing again)\n\n§8Base: %s\n\n§eIf close duration is 0 = always open.\n§eIf open duration is 0 = always closed.", "§7Atur kapan NPC ini bisa diklik member.\n\n§fStatus: %s\n§fKondisi: %s\n\n§7Closed Duration: §f%s §7(lama tutup sebelum buka)\n§7Open Duration: §f%s §7(lama buka sebelum tutup lagi)\n\n§8Base: %s\n\n§eJika durasi tutup 0 = selalu buka.\n§eJika durasi buka 0 = selalu tutup."],
