  "npc.schedule.menu.body2": ["§7Set when this NPC can be clicked by members.\n\n§f%s\n§fState: %s\n\n§7Closed Duration: §f%s §7(time closed before opening)\n§7Open Duration: §f%s §7(time open before closing again)\n\n§8Base: %s\n\n§eIf close disabled = always open when not in open window.\n§eIf open disabled = always closed after close window.", "§7Atur kapan NPC ini bisa diklik member.\n\n§f%s\n§fKondisi: %s\n\n§7Closed Duration: §f%s §7(lama tutup sebelum buka)\n§7Open Duration: §f%s §7(lama buka sebelum tutup lagi)\n\n§8Base: %s\n\n§eJika tutup nonaktif = selalu buka saat tidak di jadwal buka.\n§eJika buka nonaktif = selalu tutup setelah jadwal tutup."],
