 "bank.help.title": ["§6How Bank Works", "§6Cara Kerja Bank"],
 "bank.help.btn.ok": ["Got it", "Mengerti"],
 "bank.help.btn.back": ["Back to Bank", "Kembali ke Bank"],
 "bank.help.body.basic": ["§e=== BANK GUIDE ===\n\n§fBank keeps your money safe, separate from wallet cash.\n\n§eDeposit\n§fMove money from wallet → bank.\n\n§eWithdraw\n§fMove money from bank → wallet.\n\n§eTransfer\n§fSend bank balance to another online player.\n\n§eTransactions\n§fView your last 10 bank activities.\n\n§7Tip: Store savings in the bank so you don't spend them by accident.\n\n§8Real Bank Mode is currently OFF.\n§8Only classic deposit / withdraw / transfer are active.\n§8Admin can enable economy features in:\n§fAdmin > Member Set > Advanced Config > Bank", "§e=== PANDUAN BANK ===\n\n§fBank menyimpan uangmu dengan aman, terpisah dari uang di dompet.\n\n§eSetor\n§fPindah uang dari dompet → bank.\n\n§eTarik\n§fPindah uang dari bank → dompet.\n\n§eTransfer\n§fKirim saldo bank ke player lain yang sedang online.\n\n§eTransaksi\n§fLihat 10 aktivitas bank terakhir.\n\n§7Tips: Simpan tabungan di bank biar tidak kehabisan tidak sengaja.\n\n§8Mode Bank Real sedang MATI.\n§8Hanya setor / tarik / transfer klasik yang aktif.\n§8Admin bisa aktifkan fitur ekonomi di:\n§fAdmin > Atur Member > Advanced Config > Bank"],
 "bank.help.body.real": ["§e=== REAL BANK GUIDE ===\n\n§aReal Bank Mode is ON.\n§fRules below follow the current server settings.\n\n§e--- BASIC ACTIONS ---\n§fDeposit: wallet → bank\n§fWithdraw: bank → wallet\n§fTransfer: send bank money to an online player\n§fTransactions: last 10 bank history\n\n§e--- INTEREST (SAVINGS) ---\n§7Status: §f%s\n§7Rate: §f%s §7every §f%s\n§fIf enabled, bank savings can earn interest over real time.\n§7Interest is checked when you join or open Bank.\n\n§e--- FEES ---\n§7Deposit fee: §f%s\n§7Withdraw fee: §f%s\n§7Transfer fee: §f%s\n§fFees are taken from your side. Receiver gets the clean amount.\n§70% means free.\n\n§e--- LIMITS ---\n§7Daily withdraw limit: §f%s\n§7Minimum bank balance: §f%s\n§fDaily limit resets each UTC day.\n§fMinimum balance blocks withdraw/transfer below that floor.\n\n§e--- LOAN ---\n§7Status: §f%s\n§7Max borrow: §f%s\n§7Loan interest: §f%s\n§fIf enabled, borrow money to your wallet, then repay principal + interest.\n§7Only one active loan at a time.\n\n§8Values above are live from admin settings.\n§8Ask admin if something feels too high or unclear.", "§e=== PANDUAN BANK REAL ===\n\n§aMode Bank Real AKTIF.\n§fAturan di bawah mengikuti pengaturan server saat ini.\n\n§e--- AKSI DASAR ---\n§fSetor: dompet → bank\n§fTarik: bank → dompet\n§fTransfer: kirim uang bank ke player online\n§fTransaksi: 10 riwayat bank terakhir\n\n§e--- BUNGA (TABUNGAN) ---\n§7Status: §f%s\n§7Suku bunga: §f%s §7tiap §f%s\n§fJika aktif, tabungan bank bisa dapat bunga berdasarkan waktu nyata.\n§7Bunga dicek saat kamu join atau buka menu Bank.\n\n§e--- BIAYA ---\n§7Biaya setor: §f%s\n§7Biaya tarik: §f%s\n§7Biaya transfer: §f%s\n§fBiaya dipotong dari pihakmu. Penerima dapat jumlah bersih.\n§70% artinya gratis.\n\n§e--- LIMIT ---\n§7Limit tarik harian: §f%s\n§7Saldo bank minimum: §f%s\n§fLimit harian reset tiap hari UTC.\n§fSaldo minimum mencegah tarik/transfer di bawah batas.\n\n§e--- PINJAMAN ---\n§7Status: §f%s\n§7Maks pinjam: §f%s\n§7Bunga pinjaman: §f%s\n§fJika aktif, pinjam uang ke dompet, lalu bayar pokok + bunga.\n§7Hanya 1 pinjaman aktif per player.\n\n§8Nilai di atas live dari pengaturan admin.\n§8Tanya admin kalau ada yang terlalu tinggi atau kurang jelas."],
 "bank.loan.title": ["§eBANK LOAN", "§ePINJAMAN BANK"],
