 "bank.loan.help.title": ["§6How Loans Work", "§6Cara Kerja Pinjaman"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.blind": ["§8- §cYour screen goes dark for %s seconds", "§8- §cLayar kamu jadi gelap selama %s detik"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.slow": ["§8- §cYou walk slower", "§8- §cJalan kamu jadi lambat"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.nausea": ["§8- §cYour screen wobbles (nausea)", "§8- §cLayar kamu goyang (mual)"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.weak": ["§8- §cYour attacks get weaker", "§8- §cSerangan kamu jadi lemah"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.no_withdraw": ["§8- §cYou cannot withdraw from the bank", "§8- §cKamu tidak bisa tarik uang dari bank"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.no_transfer": ["§8- §cYou cannot transfer bank money", "§8- §cKamu tidak bisa transfer uang bank"],
 "bank.loan.help.punish.none": ["§8- §7No penalty is active right now", "§8- §7Tidak ada hukuman yang aktif sekarang"],
 "bank.loan.help.body": [
  "§e=== LOAN GUIDE ===\n\n§fA loan gives you money now, but you must pay it back later.\n\n§e1. BORROWING\n§fMax you can borrow: §a%s\n§fInterest added on top: §a%s\n§7Example: borrow 1000 with 10% interest = you owe 1100.\n§7Only one loan at a time.\n\n§e2. DEADLINE\n§fYou get §a%s days §fto repay.\n§7The countdown shows in the Bank menu.\n§7Repay any time before it hits zero - no penalty at all.\n\n§e3. IF YOU ARE LATE\n§fLate fee: §c%s §fadded every §c%s hours§f.\n§7This stacks on your total debt, so it grows fast.\n§fFee stops growing at §c%s §fof the original debt.\n\n§e4. PENALTIES WHILE LATE\n§fEvery §c%s minutes §fyou get:\n%s\n\n§e5. HOW TO CLEAR IT\n§fOpen §aBank > Loan > Repay Full§f.\n§fYou need the full owed amount in your §ewallet§f (not bank).\n§aThe moment you repay, all penalties stop immediately.\n\n§7Tip: borrow only what you can pay back in time.",
  "§e=== PANDUAN PINJAMAN ===\n\n§fPinjaman kasih kamu uang sekarang, tapi wajib dibalikin nanti.\n\n§e1. MEMINJAM\n§fMaks yang bisa dipinjam: §a%s\n§fBunga yang ditambahkan: §a%s\n§7Contoh: pinjam 1000 bunga 10% = utang kamu jadi 1100.\n§7Cuma boleh 1 pinjaman aktif.\n\n§e2. BATAS WAKTU\n§fKamu dikasih §a%s hari §funtuk melunasi.\n§7Hitungan mundurnya kelihatan di menu Bank.\n§7Bayar kapan saja sebelum habis - tidak ada denda sama sekali.\n\n§e3. KALAU TELAT\n§fDenda: §c%s §fditambah tiap §c%s jam§f.\n§7Denda numpuk ke total utang, jadi naiknya cepat.\n§fDenda berhenti nambah di §c%s §fdari utang awal.\n\n§e4. HUKUMAN SELAMA TELAT\n§fTiap §c%s menit §fkamu kena:\n%s\n\n§e5. CARA MELUNASI\n§fBuka §aBank > Pinjaman > Bayar Lunas§f.\n§fUang harus ada di §edompet§f (bukan di bank).\n§aBegitu lunas, semua hukuman langsung berhenti.\n\n§7Tips: pinjam secukupnya, sesuai kemampuan bayar."
 ],
