 "bank.cfg.loan.help.title": ["§6Loan System Guide", "§6Panduan Sistem Pinjaman"],
 "bank.cfg.loan.help.body": [
  "§e=== ADMIN LOAN GUIDE ===\n\n§fThis is what players experience with your current settings.\n\n§e1. PLAYER BORROWS\n§fThey get cash instantly, and owe principal + §a%s §finterest.\n§fThe deadline is set to §a%s days §ffrom the moment they borrow.\n§7Each player can only hold one loan at a time.\n\n§e2. BEFORE THE DEADLINE\n§fNothing bad happens. A countdown shows in their Bank menu.\n§7Repaying early has no extra cost.\n\n§e3. AFTER THE DEADLINE\n§fEvery §c%s hours§f, §c%s §fof their remaining debt is added as a fine.\n§7This compounds, so debt grows faster the longer they wait.\n§fFines stop once total added reaches §c%s§f, so debt cannot grow forever.\n\n§e4. PRESSURE EFFECTS\n§fEvery §c%s minutes §fthe player gets a dark screen for §c%s seconds§f,\n§fplus any extra effects you enabled, plus a warning message.\n§fYou can also lock withdraw and transfer so they cannot hide money.\n\n§e5. IT ENDS INSTANTLY ON REPAY\n§fRepaying clears the debt and stops every penalty in the same tick.\n\n§7Balance tip: harsh fines with a short deadline can drive players away.\n§7A 7 day deadline with a 5% fee per 24h is a fair starting point.",
  "§e=== PANDUAN PINJAMAN (ADMIN) ===\n\n§fIni yang dialami player dengan pengaturanmu saat ini.\n\n§e1. PLAYER MEMINJAM\n§fUang langsung masuk, utangnya pokok + bunga §a%s§f.\n§fBatas waktunya §a%s hari §fdihitung dari saat dia pinjam.\n§7Tiap player cuma boleh punya 1 pinjaman aktif.\n\n§e2. SEBELUM JATUH TEMPO\n§fTidak ada efek buruk. Hitungan mundur muncul di menu Bank dia.\n§7Bayar lebih cepat tidak kena biaya tambahan.\n\n§e3. SETELAH LEWAT JATUH TEMPO\n§fTiap §c%s jam§f, §c%s §fdari sisa utang ditambahkan sebagai denda.\n§7Denda ini berbunga, jadi makin lama makin besar.\n§fDenda berhenti setelah total tambahan mencapai §c%s§f, jadi utang tidak naik selamanya.\n\n§e4. EFEK TEKANAN\n§fTiap §c%s menit §fplayer kena layar gelap §c%s detik§f,\n§fditambah efek lain yang kamu nyalakan, plus pesan peringatan.\n§fKamu juga bisa mengunci tarik & transfer biar dia tidak sembunyikan uang.\n\n§e5. LANGSUNG BERHENTI SAAT LUNAS\n§fBegitu dibayar, utang hilang dan semua hukuman berhenti di tick yang sama.\n\n§7Tips: denda sadis + tenggat pendek bisa bikin player kabur.\n§7Tenggat 7 hari dengan denda 5% per 24 jam itu titik awal yang wajar."
 ],
 "bank.cfg.help.title": ["Bank Admin Guide", "Panduan Admin Bank"],
 "bank.cfg.help.close": ["Back", "Kembali"],
 "bank.cfg.help.full": ["§e=== HOW TO USE REAL BANK ===\n\n§fPath: §aAdmin > Member Set > Advanced Config > Bank\n\n§e1) REAL BANK MODE (master switch)\n§fOFF by default. Classic deposit/withdraw/transfer only.\n§fTurn ON to activate interest, fees, limits, and loans.\n§7Individual feature toggles still matter after Real Mode is ON.\n\n§e2) INTEREST\n§fPays % of current bank balance every interval (real time).\n§7Example: 1% / 1 hour on 100,000 = +1,000 each hour.\n§7Max Missed Intervals caps offline farming.\n§cTip: Start low (1% / 1h) so economy stays healthy.\n\n§e3) FEES\n§fPercentage taken on deposit, withdraw, or bank transfer.\n§7Deposit: wallet pays amount + fee, bank receives amount.\n§7Withdraw: bank pays amount + fee, wallet receives amount.\n§7Transfer: sender pays amount + fee, receiver gets amount.\n\n§e4) LIMITS\n§fDaily Withdraw Limit resets each UTC day.\n§fMinimum Balance blocks withdraw/transfer below the floor.\n\n§e5) LOAN\n§fPlayer borrows to wallet, then must repay principal + interest.\n§7Only one active loan per player.\n\n§e6) RESET TOOLS\n§fReset Player Bank clears balances.\n§fReset to Defaults turns Real Mode OFF and clears advanced values.\n\n§aRecommended first setup:\n§f1. Enable Real Mode\n§f2. Interest 1% / 1 hour\n§f3. Fees 0-2%\n§f4. Daily limit optional\n§f5. Loan off until economy is stable", "§e=== CARA PAKAI BANK REAL ===\n\n§fPath: §aAdmin > Atur Member > Advanced Config > Bank\n\n§e1) MODE BANK REAL (saklar utama)\n§fDefault MATI. Hanya setor/tarik/transfer klasik.\n§fNyalakan ON untuk aktifkan bunga, biaya, limit, dan pinjaman.\n§7Setelah Mode Real ON, toggle tiap fitur tetap harus diaktifkan terpisah.\n\n§e2) BUNGA\n§fMembayar % dari saldo bank tiap interval (waktu nyata).\n§7Contoh: 1% / 1 jam pada 100.000 = +1.000 tiap jam.\n§7Maks Interval Terlewat membatasi farming offline.\n§cTips: Mulai kecil (1% / 1 jam) biar ekonomi tetap sehat.\n\n§e3) BIAYA\n§fPersentase dipotong saat setor, tarik, atau transfer bank.\n§7Setor: dompet bayar jumlah + biaya, bank terima jumlah.\n§7Tarik: bank potong jumlah + biaya, dompet terima jumlah.\n§7Transfer: pengirim bayar jumlah + biaya, penerima dapat jumlah.\n\n§e4) LIMIT\n§fLimit Tarik Harian reset tiap hari UTC.\n§fSaldo Minimum mencegah tarik/transfer di bawah batas.\n\n§e5) PINJAMAN\n§fPlayer pinjam ke dompet, lalu wajib bayar pokok + bunga.\n§7Hanya 1 pinjaman aktif per player.\n\n§e6) TOOL RESET\n§fReset Bank Player mengosongkan saldo.\n§fReset ke Default mematikan Mode Real dan nilai lanjutan.\n\n§aSetup awal yang disarankan:\n§f1. Aktifkan Mode Real\n§f2. Bunga 1% / 1 jam\n§f3. Biaya 0-2%\n§f4. Limit harian opsional\n§f5. Pinjaman mati dulu sampai ekonomi stabil"],
