 "dp.title": ["Dynamic Pricing", "Harga Dinamis"],
 "dp.body": ["§e=== DYNAMIC PRICING ===\n\n§7Status: %s\n§7Server-wide market (all players share one counter)\n§7Price Step: §a+%s% §7every §a%s §7items sold\n§7Max Multiplier: §a%sx §7of base price\n§7Reset Interval: §a%s\n\n§7Small buys (below the item threshold) do not raise price yet.\n§7Counters reset automatically on the interval.", "§e=== HARGA DINAMIS ===\n\n§7Status: %s\n§7Pasar server-wide (semua pemain pakai 1 counter)\n§7Langkah Harga: §a+%s% §7setiap §a%s §7item terjual\n§7Pengali Maks: §a%sx §7dari harga dasar\n§7Interval Reset: §a%s\n\n§7Beli sedikit (di bawah ambang) belum menaikkan harga.\n§7Counter reset otomatis sesuai interval."],
 "dp.status.on": ["§aENABLED", "§aAKTIF"],
 "dp.status.off": ["§cDISABLED", "§cMATI"],
 "dp.btn.toggle_on": ["§aON\n§7Disable", "§aON\n§7Matikan"],
 "dp.btn.toggle_off": ["§cOFF\n§7Enable", "§cOFF\n§7Nyalakan"],
 "dp.toggle.label": ["Enable Dynamic Pricing\n§7Shared market price for everyone — rises only after enough total sales", "Aktifkan Harga Dinamis\n§7Harga pasar bersama untuk semua — naik hanya setelah total penjualan cukup"],
 "dp.btn.price_step": ["Price Step\n§7%s%", "Step\n§7%s%"],
 "dp.btn.max_multiplier": ["Max Cap\n§7%sx", "Cap\n§7%sx"],
 "dp.btn.reset_interval": ["Reset\n§7%s"],
 "dp.btn.configure": ["Settings\n§7Edit DP", "Settings\n§7Atur DP"],
 "dp.btn.view_counters": ["Counters\n§7Buy stats", "Counter\n§7Stat beli"],
 "dp.btn.manual_reset": ["Reset\n§7Clear buys", "Reset\n§7Hapus stat"],
 "dp.btn.back": ["Back", "Kembali"],
 "dp.btn.help": ["Help\n§7Guide", "Bantuan\n§7Panduan"],
 "dp.help.title": ["Dynamic Pricing Guide", "Panduan Harga Dinamis"],
 "dp.help.close": ["Close", "Tutup"],
 "dp.help.back_to_menu": ["Back", "Kembali"],
 "dp.help.full": ["§e=== HOW TO USE DYNAMIC PRICING ===\n\n§fThis is a §eSERVER-WIDE§f market.\nWhoever buys an item increases that item's demand counter for §eeveryone§f.\nIt is not per-player.\n\n§e--- ITEMS PER STEP ---\n\n§fPrice only rises after enough items are sold in total.\n§7Default example (8 items / step, +1%):\n§a- 1–7 sold: still base price\n§a- 8–15 sold: +1%\n§a- 16–23 sold: +2%\n§eBuying 1–3 items alone usually does nothing.\n\n§e--- PRICE STEP (1-20%) ---\n\n§fHow much price rises each time the threshold is reached.\n\n§e--- MAX MULTIPLIER (2-5x) ---\n\n§fHard ceiling. Example 3x: base 100 → max 300.\n\n§e--- RESET INTERVAL ---\n\n§fClears all buy counters on a real-time timer.\nPrices return toward base after reset.", "§e=== CARA KERJA HARGA DINAMIS ===\n\n§fIni pasar §eSERVER-WIDE§f.\nSiapa pun yang beli menambah counter demand item itu untuk §esemua orang§f.\nBukan per-player.\n\n§e--- ITEM PER STEP ---\n\n§fHarga baru naik setelah cukup banyak item terjual (total semua pemain).\n§7Contoh default (8 item / step, +1%):\n§a- 1–7 terjual: masih harga dasar\n§a- 8–15 terjual: +1%\n§a- 16–23 terjual: +2%\n§eBeli 1–3 item sendirian biasanya belum ngaruh.\n\n§e--- LANGKAH HARGA (1-20%) ---\n\n§fBerapa persen naik tiap kali ambang penjualan tercapai.\n\n§e--- PENGALI MAKS (2-5x) ---\n\n§fBatas keras. Contoh 3x: dasar 100 → maks 300.\n\n§e--- INTERVAL RESET ---\n\n§fMengosongkan semua counter beli (waktu nyata).\nHarga kembali ke dasar setelah reset."],
